:: Guest - basement invite [Place bg-basement]

<h1 class="ptitle">BASEMENT</h1>
<br />

<center>
    <<image 'places/cabin/guest_basement_invite.jpg' sfw>>
</center>
<br />

You pulled <<=setup.displayName($tmpGirl)>> aside and asked if she wanted to come spend some time with you down in the basement.
<br /><br />

<<if ($tmpGirl.likesGuys ?? true)>>
    <<if ($tmpGirl.relationship ?? 0) >= 85>>
    <<sayNpc $tmpGirl>>
        The basement? Sure. Lead the way.
    <</sayNpc>>
    <<else>>
    <<sayNpc $tmpGirl>>
        The basement? I — okay. Yeah.
    <</sayNpc>>
    <</if>>
    <br />
    She followed you to the basement door without another word.
    <br /><br />
    <<link 'Take her down'>>
        <<run $guests[$guestId].basementVoluntary = true>>
        <<goto 'Basement'>>
    <</link>><<link 'Actually, never mind'>>
        <<if $tmpGirlBack>><<goto $tmpGirlBack>><<else>><<goto 'Guest house'>><</if>>
    <</link>>
<<else>>
    <<sayNpc $tmpGirl>>
        No thanks. That's not really my thing.
    <</sayNpc>>
    <br />
    She walked away without another word.
    <br /><br />
    <<link 'Go back'>>
        <<if $tmpGirlBack>><<goto $tmpGirlBack>><<else>><<goto 'Guest house'>><</if>>
    <</link>>
<</if>>
